--- body ---
## Scope

Run a bundled public technical fixture against the selected entry on the
machine and provider that will create or query vectors. Keep this distinct from
library-derived fusion calibration and retrieval-quality gates.

## Exit criteria

- The gate checks load, shape, finite values, normalization, templates,
  provider-local determinism and matched-over-unmatched discrimination.
- Results are cached only for the exact entry fingerprint and environment
  shape; a changed component revalidates.
- Failure blocks semantic use explicitly and never selects another entry.
- The daemon and every client reject a stale or mismatched validation result.
